	+ Algorithms, data structures, and object-oriented design principles
	+ Version control and unit testing
* Soft skills:
	+ Effective communication
	+ Ability to receive feedback, coaching, and mentorship
	+ Strong problem-solving skills

Note that the job description emphasizes the importance of being able to work with others on a team, as well as being open to feedback and mentorship.
